# Onobase — line endings
# Added 09-20-2026 when docking with Erudite.
# The git pre-commit shim MUST keep LF line endings and no byte-order mark.
# Git runs it through /bin/sh; CRLF in it makes every commit fail with a
# message that does not mention line endings, which is how an afternoon
# disappears. Erudite\DOCKING.md step 5c.

.githooks/pre-commit text eol=lf
